se, especially extended limbs. All poses SAME pixels per body length, do not scale collapse poses up.\nPyre Colossus: same shield SCREEN LEFT, claw SCREEN RIGHT, furnace chest, large armored two-legged guardian. Guard support action: deep brace, lift and present shield and open claw palm, hold, recover. Idle slow furnace breath, stable soles. Die buckle knees and collapse, shield remains attached.\nLAYOUT PRIORITY: wide LANDSCAPE 1536x1024 canvas. Exactly 4 columns x4rows. ALL 16 poses have at least 35px empty transparent space on ALL sides of each cell. Same scale throughout. No glow background.",
